# SauceDemo – QA Automation Assessment

## 1. Project Overview

This project automates the SauceDemo e-commerce application using **Playwright with TypeScript** and the **Page Object Model (POM)** design pattern.

The objective is to validate critical business functionalities such as user login, product sorting, shopping cart management, checkout, form validation, and access restrictions after logout.

**Application URL:** https://www.saucedemo.com/

**Automation Framework:** Playwright  
**Programming Language:** TypeScript  
**Design Pattern:** Page Object Model (POM)  
**Test Data:** JSON  
**Reporting:** Playwright HTML and JUnit XML

